      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 121,
      "version": 174,
      "versionNonce": 458744220,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788495379747,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Loader resolves lib1's &foo using exe's dynsym entry.\nBoth p1 and p2 become foo@plt, even before foo is called.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Loader resolves lib1's &foo using exe's dynsym entry.\nBoth p1 and p2 become foo@plt, even before foo is called.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 68,
      "index": "b4I",
      "autoResize": false,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "callout2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 251.52734375,
      "y": 701.46875,
      "width": 955.35546875,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 122,
      "version": 336,
      "versionNonce": 788167068,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788495401993,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Loader resolves lib1's &foo using exe's dynsym entry.\nBoth p1 and p2 become foo@plt, even before foo is called.\nLazy binding can still happen later:\nfoo@plt is a stable callable address; the real libfoo::foo target may be resolved on first call.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Loader resolves lib1's &foo using exe's dynsym entry.\nBoth p1 and p2 become foo@plt, even before foo is called.\nLazy binding can still happen later:\nfoo@plt is a stable callable address; the real libfoo::foo target may be resolved on first call.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 68,
